        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Baidu Baike, Chinese Wikipedia\n- Organizations: Wikimedia Foundation\n- Topics: Chinese-language online encyclopedias\n\nFacts:\n- On 20 April 2006, Baidu Baike released its test version.\n- Within three weeks of its test release, Baidu Baike grew to more than 90,000 articles and surpassed Chinese Wikipedia in article count.\n- Chinese Wikipedia is the Standard Chinese-language edition of Wikipedia.\n- Chinese Wikipedia is run by the Wikimedia Foundation.",
